 "credits": "Croker, Thomas Crofton (author, d. 1854)",
 "gutenberg": "Project Gutenberg eBook #39752 — https://www.gutenberg.org/ebooks/39752 (copied via the GITenberg mirror)",
 "copyright": "Public domain worldwide: the text was published long ago and every named author/translator died in or before 1955.",
 "markdown_file": "Europe/Ireland/098 - The Wonderful Tune.md",
 "stats": {
  "paragraphs": 297,
